<section id="Ax1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix">Additional Preliminaries and Technical Details</h2>

<section id="Ax1.SS1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection"><span id="Ax1.SS1.6" class="ltx_text">-A</span> </span><span id="Ax1.SS1.7" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Kernels</span></h3>

<div id="Ax1.SS1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Ax1.SS1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Minimizing the energy, ie the kernel potential <math id="Ax1.SS1.p1.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\sum_{\mathbf{x},\mathbf{y}}=K(\mathbf{x},\mathbf{y})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>𝐱</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐲</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0.278em">=</mo><mi>K</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐲</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\sum_{\mathbf{x},\mathbf{y}}=K(\mathbf{x},\mathbf{y})</annotation></semantics></math>, of a point configuration has shown to have direct connection to the optimisation of contrastive learning objectives <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib1" title="" class="ltx_ref">1</a>, <a href="#bib.bib11" title="" class="ltx_ref">11</a>]</cite>. Kernels are of the form <math id="Ax1.SS1.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{K(\mathbf{x},\mathbf{y})=\kappa(\|\mathbf{x}-\mathbf{y}\|^{2})}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>K</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐲</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>κ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><mi>𝐱</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>𝐲</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{K(\mathbf{x},\mathbf{y})=\kappa(\|\mathbf{x}-\mathbf{y}\|^{2})}</annotation></semantics></math>, with <math id="Ax1.SS1.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\kappa:(0,4]\to\mathbb{R}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>κ</mi><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><mi>ℝ</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\kappa:(0,4]\to\mathbb{R}</annotation></semantics></math> and the limit <math id="Ax1.SS1.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\underset{x\to 0^{+}}{\lim}\kappa(x)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><munder accentunder="true"><mo>lim</mo><mrow><mi mathsize="0.700em">x</mi><mo mathsize="0.700em" stretchy="false">→</mo><msup><mn mathsize="0.700em">0</mn><mo mathsize="0.710em">+</mo></msup></mrow></munder><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>κ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\underset{x\to 0^{+}}{\lim}\kappa(x)</annotation></semantics></math> exists and is bounded, and <math id="Ax1.SS1.p1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\gamma&gt;0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\gamma&gt;0</annotation></semantics></math> is a weighting coefficient.</p>
</div>
<div id="Ax1.SS1.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Ax1.SS1.p2.1" class="ltx_p">Notable examples of kernels that obey the conditions that we encounter in this paper are the following:</p>
<ul id="Ax1.I1" class="ltx_itemize">
<li id="Ax1.I1.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="Ax1.I1.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Ax1.I1.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="Ax1.I1.i1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Gaussian</span>: <math id="Ax1.I1.i1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{K^{\text{gauss}}_{t}(\mathbf{x},\mathbf{y})=e^{-t\|\mathbf{x}-\mathbf{y}\|^{2}}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi>K</mi><mi>t</mi><mtext>gauss</mtext></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐲</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><mi>𝐱</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>𝐲</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{K^{\text{gauss}}_{t}(\mathbf{x},\mathbf{y})=e^{-t\|\mathbf{x}-\mathbf{y}\|^{2}}}</annotation></semantics></math> <math id="Ax1.I1.i1.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="=\kappa^{\text{gauss}}_{t}(\|\mathbf{x}-\mathbf{y}\|^{2})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>κ</mi><mi>t</mi><mtext>gauss</mtext></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><mi>𝐱</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>𝐲</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">=\kappa^{\text{gauss}}_{t}(\|\mathbf{x}-\mathbf{y}\|^{2})</annotation></semantics></math>, where <math id="Ax1.I1.i1.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\kappa^{\text{gauss}}_{t}(x;t)=e^{-tx}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi>κ</mi><mi>t</mi><mtext>gauss</mtext></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\kappa^{\text{gauss}}_{t}(x;t)=e^{-tx}</annotation></semantics></math>.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="Ax1.I1.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="Ax1.I1.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Ax1.I1.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="Ax1.I1.i2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Logarithmic</span>:
<math id="Ax1.I1.i2.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{K^{\text{log}}_{s,\beta}(\mathbf{x},\mathbf{y})=-\frac{1}{2}\log\left(s\|\mathbf{x}-\mathbf{y}\|^{2}+\beta\right)}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi>K</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>β</mi></mrow><mtext>log</mtext></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐲</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><mi>𝐱</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>𝐲</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mo>+</mo><mi>β</mi></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{K^{\text{log}}_{s,\beta}(\mathbf{x},\mathbf{y})=-\frac{1}{2}\log\left(s\|\mathbf{x}-\mathbf{y}\|^{2}+\beta\right)}</annotation></semantics></math><math id="Ax1.I1.i2.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="=\kappa^{\text{log}}_{s,\beta}(\|\mathbf{x}-\mathbf{y}\|^{2})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>κ</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>β</mi></mrow><mtext>log</mtext></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><mi>𝐱</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>𝐲</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">=\kappa^{\text{log}}_{s,\beta}(\|\mathbf{x}-\mathbf{y}\|^{2})</annotation></semantics></math>, where <math id="Ax1.I1.i2.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\kappa^{\text{log}}_{s,\beta}(x)=-\frac{1}{2}\log\left(sx+\beta\right)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi>κ</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>β</mi></mrow><mtext>log</mtext></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><mo>+</mo><mi>β</mi></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\kappa^{\text{log}}_{s,\beta}(x)=-\frac{1}{2}\log\left(sx+\beta\right)</annotation></semantics></math>.</p>
</div></li>
</ul>
</div>
<div id="Ax1.SS1.p3" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Ax1.SS1.p3.1" class="ltx_p">With elementary derivations, it is easy to see that <math id="Ax1.SS1.p3.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\kappa^{\text{gauss}}_{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mi>κ</mi><mi>t</mi><mtext>gauss</mtext></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\kappa^{\text{gauss}}_{t}</annotation></semantics></math> is strictly decreasing and convex for <math id="Ax1.SS1.p3.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t&gt;0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t&gt;0</annotation></semantics></math>. For <math id="Ax1.SS1.p3.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="s&gt;-2" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">s&gt;-2</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="Ax1.SS1.p3.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\kappa^{\text{riesz}}_{s}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mi>κ</mi><mi>s</mi><mtext>riesz</mtext></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\kappa^{\text{riesz}}_{s}</annotation></semantics></math> is strictly decreasing and strictly convex, while the same holds for <math id="Ax1.SS1.p3.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\kappa^{\text{log}}_{s,\beta}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mi>κ</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>β</mi></mrow><mtext>log</mtext></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\kappa^{\text{log}}_{s,\beta}</annotation></semantics></math> when <math id="Ax1.SS1.p3.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="s,\beta&gt;0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>β</mi></mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">s,\beta&gt;0</annotation></semantics></math>.</p>
</div>
<div id="Ax1.SS1.p4" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Ax1.SS1.p4.1" class="ltx_p">Additionally, for <math id="Ax1.SS1.p4.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t&gt;0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t&gt;0</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="Ax1.SS1.p4.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\kappa^{\text{gauss}}_{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mi>κ</mi><mi>t</mi><mtext>gauss</mtext></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\kappa^{\text{gauss}}_{t}</annotation></semantics></math> is strictly completely monotone, while the same holds for <math id="Ax1.SS1.p4.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\kappa^{\text{log}}_{s,\beta}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mi>κ</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>β</mi></mrow><mtext>log</mtext></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\kappa^{\text{log}}_{s,\beta}</annotation></semantics></math> for <math id="Ax1.SS1.p4.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="s,\beta&gt;0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>β</mi></mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">s,\beta&gt;0</annotation></semantics></math>.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="Ax1.SS2" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection"><span id="Ax1.SS2.6" class="ltx_text">-B</span> </span><span id="Ax1.SS2.7" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Mini-Batch Objectives</span></h3>

<div id="Ax1.SS2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Ax1.SS2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Here we re-write the PVC, MV-InfoNCE and MV-DHEL objectives in the InfoNCE form by applying the gaussian kernel on equations (<a href="#S3.E6" title="Equation 6 ‣ III-E3 PVC ‣ III-E Mutli-View CL: Aggregating Two-View Losses ‣ III Preliminaries on Contrastive Learning ‣ A Principled Framework for Multi-View Contrastive Learning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">6</span></a>), (<a href="#S4.E11" title="Equation 11 ‣ IV-B1 Multi-view InfoNCE ‣ IV-B Multi-View Extensions ‣ IV Multi-View Contrastive Objectives ‣ A Principled Framework for Multi-View Contrastive Learning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">11</span></a>), (<a href="#S4.E12" title="Equation 12 ‣ IV-B2 Multi-view DHEL ‣ IV-B Multi-View Extensions ‣ IV Multi-View Contrastive Objectives ‣ A Principled Framework for Multi-View Contrastive Learning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">12</span></a>).</p>
</div>
<div id="Ax1.SS2.p2" class="ltx_para">
<table id="Ax1.E16" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="Ax1.E16.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\begin{split}L_{\textnormal{PVC}}(\bm{\mathsfit{U}})&amp;=\frac{-1}{M(N-1)}\bigg(\sum_{l\in[N],{\color[rgb]{0.1328,0.5469,0.1328}l^{\prime}\in[N]\setminus l}\atop i\in[M]}\log K(\bm{\mathsfit{U}}_{i,l,:},\bm{\mathsfit{U}}_{i,{\color[rgb]{0.1328,0.5469,0.1328}l^{\prime}},:})+\sum_{l,l^{\prime}\in[N]\setminus l\atop i\in[M]}\log\big(\sum_{{\color[rgb]{0.6992,0.1328,0.1328}j\in[M]\setminus i\atop{m\in[N]}}}K(\bm{\mathsfit{U}}_{i,l,:},\bm{\mathsfit{U}}_{{\color[rgb]{0.6992,0.1328,0.1328}j,m},:})+K(\bm{\mathsfit{U}}_{i,l,:},\bm{\mathsfit{U}}_{{j,l^{\prime}},:})\big)\bigg)\\
&amp;=\frac{-1}{M(N-1)}\sum_{l\in[N],{\color[rgb]{0.1328,0.5469,0.1328}l^{\prime}\in[N]\setminus l}\atop i\in[M]}\log\left(\frac{e^{\bm{\mathsfit{U}}_{i,l,:}^{\top}\bm{\mathsfit{U}}_{i,{\color[rgb]{0.1328,0.5469,0.1328}l^{\prime}},:}/\tau}}{e^{\bm{\mathsfit{U}}_{i,l,:}^{\top}\bm{\mathsfit{U}}_{i,{\color[rgb]{0.1328,0.5469,0.1328}l^{\prime}},:}/\tau}+\sum_{{\color[rgb]{0.6992,0.1328,0.1328}j\in[M]\setminus i\atop{m\in[N]}}}e^{\bm{\mathsfit{U}}_{i,l,:}^{\top}\bm{\mathsfit{U}}_{{\color[rgb]{0.6992,0.1328,0.1328}j,m},:}/\tau}}\right)\end{split}" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mtable columnspacing="0pt" displaystyle="true" rowspacing="0pt"><mtr><mtd class="ltx_align_right" columnalign="right"><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mtext>PVC</mtext></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝑼</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>M</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac><mo maxsize="2.100em" minsize="2.100em">(</mo><mo lspace="0em" movablelimits="false">∑</mo><msub><mrow></mrow><mfrac linethickness="0pt"><mrow><mrow><mi>l</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><msup><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#228B22;" mathcolor="#228B22">l</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#228B22;" mathcolor="#228B22">′</mo></msup><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#228B22;" mathcolor="#228B22">∈</mo><mrow><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#228B22;" mathcolor="#228B22" stretchy="false">[</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#228B22;" mathcolor="#228B22">N</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#228B22;" mathcolor="#228B22" stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#228B22;" mathcolor="#228B22">∖</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#228B22;" mathcolor="#228B22">l</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>M</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac></msub><mi>log</mi><mi>K</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝑼</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>l</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝑼</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#228B22;" mathcolor="#228B22">l</mi><msup><mrow></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#228B22;" mathcolor="#228B22">′</mo></msup><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo rspace="0.055em">+</mo><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><msub><mrow></mrow><mfrac linethickness="0pt"><mrow><mi>l</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><msup><mi>l</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mo>∖</mo><mi>l</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>M</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac></msub><mi>log</mi><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">(</mo><mo lspace="0em" movablelimits="false">∑</mo><msub><mrow></mrow><mfrac style="--ltx-fg-color:#B22222;" linethickness="0pt" mathcolor="#B22222"><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#B22222;" mathcolor="#B22222">j</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#B22222;" mathcolor="#B22222">∈</mo><mrow><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#B22222;" mathcolor="#B22222" stretchy="false">[</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#B22222;" mathcolor="#B22222">M</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#B22222;" mathcolor="#B22222" stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#B22222;" mathcolor="#B22222">∖</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#B22222;" mathcolor="#B22222">i</mi></mrow></mrow><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#B22222;" mathcolor="#B22222">m</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#B22222;" mathcolor="#B22222">∈</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#B22222;" mathcolor="#B22222" stretchy="false">[</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#B22222;" mathcolor="#B22222">N</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#B22222;" mathcolor="#B22222" stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac></msub><mi>K</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝑼</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>l</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝑼</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#B22222;" mathcolor="#B22222">j</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#B22222;" mathcolor="#B22222">,</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#B22222;" mathcolor="#B22222">m</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>K</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝑼</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>l</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝑼</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>l</mi><msup><mrow></mrow><mo>′</mo></msup><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">)</mo><mo maxsize="2.100em" minsize="2.100em">)</mo></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>M</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><msub><mrow></mrow><mfrac linethickness="0pt"><mrow><mrow><mi>l</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><msup><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#228B22;" mathcolor="#228B22">l</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#228B22;" mathcolor="#228B22">′</mo></msup><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#228B22;" mathcolor="#228B22">∈</mo><mrow><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#228B22;" mathcolor="#228B22" stretchy="false">[</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#228B22;" mathcolor="#228B22">N</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#228B22;" mathcolor="#228B22" stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#228B22;" mathcolor="#228B22">∖</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#228B22;" mathcolor="#228B22">l</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>M</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac></msub><mi>log</mi><mo>(</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>e</mi><msup><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>𝑼</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>l</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow></msub><msup><mrow></mrow><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mi>𝑼</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#228B22;" mathcolor="#228B22">l</mi><msup><mrow></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#228B22;" mathcolor="#228B22">′</mo></msup><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow></msub><mo>/</mo><mi>τ</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mi>e</mi><msup><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>𝑼</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>l</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow></msub><msup><mrow></mrow><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mi>𝑼</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#228B22;" mathcolor="#228B22">l</mi><msup><mrow></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#228B22;" mathcolor="#228B22">′</mo></msup><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow></msub><mo>/</mo><mi>τ</mi></mrow></msup><mo rspace="0.055em">+</mo><mo>∑</mo><msub><mrow></mrow><mfrac style="--ltx-fg-color:#B22222;" linethickness="0pt" mathcolor="#B22222"><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#B22222;" mathcolor="#B22222">j</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#B22222;" mathcolor="#B22222">∈</mo><mrow><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#B22222;" mathcolor="#B22222" stretchy="false">[</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#B22222;" mathcolor="#B22222">M</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#B22222;" mathcolor="#B22222" stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#B22222;" mathcolor="#B22222">∖</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#B22222;" mathcolor="#B22222">i</mi></mrow></mrow><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#B22222;" mathcolor="#B22222">m</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#B22222;" mathcolor="#B22222">∈</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#B22222;" mathcolor="#B22222" stretchy="false">[</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#B22222;" mathcolor="#B22222">N</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#B22222;" mathcolor="#B22222" stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac></msub><mi>e</mi><msup><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>𝑼</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>l</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow></msub><msup><mrow></mrow><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mi>𝑼</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#B22222;" mathcolor="#B22222">j</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#B22222;" mathcolor="#B22222">,</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#B22222;" mathcolor="#B22222">m</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow></msub><mo>/</mo><mi>τ</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>)</mo></mrow></mtd></mtr></mtable><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\begin{split}L_{\textnormal{PVC}}(\bm{\mathsfit{U}})&amp;=\frac{-1}{M(N-1)}\bigg(\sum_{l\in[N],{\color[rgb]{0.1328,0.5469,0.1328}l^{\prime}\in[N]\setminus l}\atop i\in[M]}\log K(\bm{\mathsfit{U}}_{i,l,:},\bm{\mathsfit{U}}_{i,{\color[rgb]{0.1328,0.5469,0.1328}l^{\prime}},:})+\sum_{l,l^{\prime}\in[N]\setminus l\atop i\in[M]}\log\big(\sum_{{\color[rgb]{0.6992,0.1328,0.1328}j\in[M]\setminus i\atop{m\in[N]}}}K(\bm{\mathsfit{U}}_{i,l,:},\bm{\mathsfit{U}}_{{\color[rgb]{0.6992,0.1328,0.1328}j,m},:})+K(\bm{\mathsfit{U}}_{i,l,:},\bm{\mathsfit{U}}_{{j,l^{\prime}},:})\big)\bigg)\\
&amp;=\frac{-1}{M(N-1)}\sum_{l\in[N],{\color[rgb]{0.1328,0.5469,0.1328}l^{\prime}\in[N]\setminus l}\atop i\in[M]}\log\left(\frac{e^{\bm{\mathsfit{U}}_{i,l,:}^{\top}\bm{\mathsfit{U}}_{i,{\color[rgb]{0.1328,0.5469,0.1328}l^{\prime}},:}/\tau}}{e^{\bm{\mathsfit{U}}_{i,l,:}^{\top}\bm{\mathsfit{U}}_{i,{\color[rgb]{0.1328,0.5469,0.1328}l^{\prime}},:}/\tau}+\sum_{{\color[rgb]{0.6992,0.1328,0.1328}j\in[M]\setminus i\atop{m\in[N]}}}e^{\bm{\mathsfit{U}}_{i,l,:}^{\top}\bm{\mathsfit{U}}_{{\color[rgb]{0.6992,0.1328,0.1328}j,m},:}/\tau}}\right)\end{split}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(16)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="Ax1.SS2.p3" class="ltx_para">
<table id="Ax1.E17" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="Ax1.E17.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\begin{split}L_{\textnormal{MV-InfoNCE}}(\bm{\mathsfit{U}})&amp;=\frac{1}{M}\sum_{i\in[M]}-\log{\sum_{l\in[N]\atop{\color[rgb]{0.1328,0.5469,0.1328}l^{\prime}\in[N]\setminus l}}K(\bm{\mathsfit{U}}_{i,l,:}^{\top}\bm{\mathsfit{U}}_{i,{\color[rgb]{0.1328,0.5469,0.1328}l^{\prime}},:})}+\frac{1}{M}\sum_{i\in[M]}\log{\sum_{l\in[N]\atop{{\color[rgb]{0.6992,0.1328,0.1328}j\in[M]\atop m\in[N]\setminus l}}}K(\bm{\mathsfit{U}}_{i,l,:}^{\top}\bm{\mathsfit{U}}_{{\color[rgb]{0.6992,0.1328,0.1328}j,m},:})}\\
&amp;=\frac{1}{M}\sum_{i=1}^{M}-\log\left(\frac{\sum_{l\in[N]\atop{\color[rgb]{0.1328,0.5469,0.1328}l^{\prime}\in[N]\setminus l}}^{N}e^{\bm{\mathsfit{U}}_{i,l,:}^{\top}\bm{\mathsfit{U}}_{i,{\color[rgb]{0.1328,0.5469,0.1328}l^{\prime}},:}{/\tau}}}{\sum_{l\in[N]\atop{{\color[rgb]{0.6992,0.1328,0.1328}j\in[M]\atop m\in[N]\setminus l}}}e^{\bm{\mathsfit{U}}_{i,l,:}^{\top}\bm{\mathsfit{U}}_{{\color[rgb]{0.6992,0.1328,0.1328}j,m,}:}{/\tau}}}\right)\end{split}" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mtable columnspacing="0pt" displaystyle="true" rowspacing="0pt"><mtr><mtd class="ltx_align_right" columnalign="right"><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mtext>MV-InfoNCE</mtext></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝑼</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>M</mi></mfrac><mo movablelimits="false" rspace="0em">∑</mo><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>M</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em">−</mo><mi>log</mi><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><msub><mrow></mrow><mfrac linethickness="0pt"><mrow><mi>l</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><msup><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#228B22;" mathcolor="#228B22">l</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#228B22;" mathcolor="#228B22">′</mo></msup><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#228B22;" mathcolor="#228B22">∈</mo><mrow><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#228B22;" mathcolor="#228B22" stretchy="false">[</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#228B22;" mathcolor="#228B22">N</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#228B22;" mathcolor="#228B22" stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#228B22;" mathcolor="#228B22">∖</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#228B22;" mathcolor="#228B22">l</mi></mrow></mrow></mfrac></msub><mi>K</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝑼</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>l</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow></msub><msup><mrow></mrow><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mi>𝑼</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#228B22;" mathcolor="#228B22">l</mi><msup><mrow></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#228B22;" mathcolor="#228B22">′</mo></msup><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>M</mi></mfrac><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>M</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mi>log</mi><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><msub><mrow></mrow><mfrac linethickness="0pt"><mrow><mi>l</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mfrac style="--ltx-fg-color:#B22222;" linethickness="0pt" mathcolor="#B22222"><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#B22222;" mathcolor="#B22222">j</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#B22222;" mathcolor="#B22222">∈</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#B22222;" mathcolor="#B22222" stretchy="false">[</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#B22222;" mathcolor="#B22222">M</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#B22222;" mathcolor="#B22222" stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#B22222;" mathcolor="#B22222">m</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#B22222;" mathcolor="#B22222">∈</mo><mrow><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#B22222;" mathcolor="#B22222" stretchy="false">[</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#B22222;" mathcolor="#B22222">N</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#B22222;" mathcolor="#B22222" stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#B22222;" mathcolor="#B22222">∖</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#B22222;" mathcolor="#B22222">l</mi></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mfrac></msub><mi>K</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝑼</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>l</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow></msub><msup><mrow></mrow><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mi>𝑼</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#B22222;" mathcolor="#B22222">j</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#B22222;" mathcolor="#B22222">,</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#B22222;" mathcolor="#B22222">m</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>M</mi></mfrac><mo movablelimits="false" rspace="0em">∑</mo><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><msup><mrow></mrow><mi>M</mi></msup><mo lspace="0em">−</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>(</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>∑</mo><msub><mrow></mrow><mfrac linethickness="0pt"><mrow><mi>l</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><msup><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#228B22;" mathcolor="#228B22">l</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#228B22;" mathcolor="#228B22">′</mo></msup><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#228B22;" mathcolor="#228B22">∈</mo><mrow><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#228B22;" mathcolor="#228B22" stretchy="false">[</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#228B22;" mathcolor="#228B22">N</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#228B22;" mathcolor="#228B22" stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#228B22;" mathcolor="#228B22">∖</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#228B22;" mathcolor="#228B22">l</mi></mrow></mrow></mfrac></msub><msup><mrow></mrow><mi>N</mi></msup><mi>e</mi><msup><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>𝑼</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>l</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow></msub><msup><mrow></mrow><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mi>𝑼</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#228B22;" mathcolor="#228B22">l</mi><msup><mrow></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#228B22;" mathcolor="#228B22">′</mo></msup><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow></msub><mo>/</mo><mi>τ</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mo>∑</mo><msub><mrow></mrow><mfrac linethickness="0pt"><mrow><mi>l</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mfrac style="--ltx-fg-color:#B22222;" linethickness="0pt" mathcolor="#B22222"><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#B22222;" mathcolor="#B22222">j</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#B22222;" mathcolor="#B22222">∈</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#B22222;" mathcolor="#B22222" stretchy="false">[</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#B22222;" mathcolor="#B22222">M</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#B22222;" mathcolor="#B22222" stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#B22222;" mathcolor="#B22222">m</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#B22222;" mathcolor="#B22222">∈</mo><mrow><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#B22222;" mathcolor="#B22222" stretchy="false">[</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#B22222;" mathcolor="#B22222">N</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#B22222;" mathcolor="#B22222" stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#B22222;" mathcolor="#B22222">∖</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#B22222;" mathcolor="#B22222">l</mi></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mfrac></msub><mi>e</mi><msup><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>𝑼</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>l</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow></msub><msup><mrow></mrow><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mi>𝑼</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#B22222;" mathcolor="#B22222">j</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#B22222;" mathcolor="#B22222">,</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#B22222;" mathcolor="#B22222">m</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#B22222;" mathcolor="#B22222">,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow></msub><mo>/</mo><mi>τ</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>)</mo></mrow></mtd></mtr></mtable><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\begin{split}L_{\textnormal{MV-InfoNCE}}(\bm{\mathsfit{U}})&amp;=\frac{1}{M}\sum_{i\in[M]}-\log{\sum_{l\in[N]\atop{\color[rgb]{0.1328,0.5469,0.1328}l^{\prime}\in[N]\setminus l}}K(\bm{\mathsfit{U}}_{i,l,:}^{\top}\bm{\mathsfit{U}}_{i,{\color[rgb]{0.1328,0.5469,0.1328}l^{\prime}},:})}+\frac{1}{M}\sum_{i\in[M]}\log{\sum_{l\in[N]\atop{{\color[rgb]{0.6992,0.1328,0.1328}j\in[M]\atop m\in[N]\setminus l}}}K(\bm{\mathsfit{U}}_{i,l,:}^{\top}\bm{\mathsfit{U}}_{{\color[rgb]{0.6992,0.1328,0.1328}j,m},:})}\\
&amp;=\frac{1}{M}\sum_{i=1}^{M}-\log\left(\frac{\sum_{l\in[N]\atop{\color[rgb]{0.1328,0.5469,0.1328}l^{\prime}\in[N]\setminus l}}^{N}e^{\bm{\mathsfit{U}}_{i,l,:}^{\top}\bm{\mathsfit{U}}_{i,{\color[rgb]{0.1328,0.5469,0.1328}l^{\prime}},:}{/\tau}}}{\sum_{l\in[N]\atop{{\color[rgb]{0.6992,0.1328,0.1328}j\in[M]\atop m\in[N]\setminus l}}}e^{\bm{\mathsfit{U}}_{i,l,:}^{\top}\bm{\mathsfit{U}}_{{\color[rgb]{0.6992,0.1328,0.1328}j,m,}:}{/\tau}}}\right)\end{split}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
